tpm 1
boot power
# select-card-full: a blank card in port 1, a full card (15 blocks of other files) in port 2.
# Option mode (as select-option), then: Options, Save to port 2: no file and no room ("card
# full", 120 frames, back to the prompt), Circle; Options, Load from port 2 ("no data"),
# Circle. Exit; on the mode select, Start+Select held: the soft reset (SELECT exits to TITLE).
card 2 re/cards/full.mcd.gz
program SW_ON
program TIT_DEMO
100 1 START
program TITLE
100 1 START
program SELECT
70 2 LEFT
80 2 CROSS
110 2 CROSS
220 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+10 2 RIGHT
+10 2 CROSS
+10 2 RIGHT
+10 2 CROSS
+140 2 CIRCLE
+10 2 LEFT
+10 2 CROSS
+10 2 RIGHT
+10 2 CROSS
+140 2 CIRCLE
+10 2 DOWN
+6 2 DOWN
+10 2 CROSS
+90 125 START+SELECT
